{"title": "Bladesong Damage Charge (Condition)", "pageid": 49024, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bladesong_Damage_Charge_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack type", "Has status properties", "Conditions", "Patch 8 content"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bladesong Damage Charge Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Bladesong_Damage_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Bladesong Damage Charge</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>A charge that will increase how much damage you deal to enemies by <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a> when using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong_Climax\" title=\"Bladesong Climax\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp/25px-Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp/38px-Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp/50px-Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bladesong Climax\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp/25px-Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong_Climax\" title=\"Bladesong Climax\">Bladesong Climax</a>.</li>\n<li>You can accumulate these charges by casting Level 1 spells or above that are not weapon attacks. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BLADESONG_DAMAGE_CHARGE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BLADESONG_DAMAGE_CHARGE+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BLADESONG_DAMAGE_CHARGE+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BLADESONG_DAMAGE_CHARGE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CBLADESONG_DAMAGE_CHARGE%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CBLADESONG_DAMAGE_CHARGE%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/38px-Sort_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"If already applied\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\">If already applied</a>: add to duration\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/FreezeDuration\" title=\"Status properties/FreezeDuration\">FreezeDuration</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Some recastable spells like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Move_Moonbeam\" title=\"Move Moonbeam\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp/20px-Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp/30px-Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp/40px-Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Move Moonbeam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp/20px-Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Move_Moonbeam\" title=\"Move Moonbeam\">Move Moonbeam</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Activate_Witch_Bolt\" title=\"Activate Witch Bolt\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Activate_Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp/20px-Activate_Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Activate_Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp/30px-Activate_Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Activate_Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp/40px-Activate_Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Activate Witch Bolt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Activate_Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp/20px-Activate_Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Activate_Witch_Bolt_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Activate_Witch_Bolt\" title=\"Activate Witch Bolt\">Activate Witch Bolt</a> do not count towards generating charges. However, the list of exclusions is not comprehensive and other free recasts <em>do</em> generate charges such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Activate_Call_Lightning\" title=\"Activate Call Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/20px-Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/30px-Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/40px-Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Activate Call Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/20px-Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Activate_Call_Lightning_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Activate_Call_Lightning\" title=\"Activate Call Lightning\">Activate Call Lightning</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Bladesong_Damage_Charge\">Sources of Bladesong Damage Charge</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong\" title=\"Bladesong\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp/30px-Bladesong_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp/45px-Bladesong_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp/60px-Bladesong_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bladesong\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp/30px-Bladesong_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong\" title=\"Bladesong\">Bladesong</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none